<p>Reposition some of your bones, healing yourself for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">107, 257, 370, 465, 547.</acronym></p><p>At level 5, you will gain the ability to completely re-assemble your body should it be destroyed (can only be used once).</p>